  "description": "Meta-package that includes all database providers for ORMData ORM. Provides backward compatibility with previous monolithic versions. For production use, consider installing only the specific provider package you need (ORMData.SqlServer, ORMData.PostgreSql, ORMData.MySql, or ORMData.Sqlite) to reduce package size.",
